# T4 · T-42 런처 바(실제 창 · Windows 러너): 항목 1개(cmd /c exit) → 도구 모음 아래 24 밴드 → launch:0 = 덤프 last launched · 끄면 0.
id: launcher
title: 퀵 런처 바 배치 · 실행 · 토글
tree: file a.txt 3
settings: ui.lang=en
settings: launcher.visible=on
settings: launcher.seed=2
# 실행 대상은 OS마다 다르다(T-117): Windows = cmd /c exit · Unix = /bin/sh -c exit.
settings@windows: launcher.items=Shell|cmd.exe|/c exit
settings@unix: launcher.items=Shell|/bin/sh|-c exit
cmd: @ready:layout.dump:<out>/layout.txt
cmd: @ready:launch:0
cmd: @ready:launcher.dump:<out>/launcher.txt
cmd: @ready:assert.launcher:last Shell launched
cmd: @ready:view.launcher
cmd: @ready:layout.dump:<out>/layout2.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: layout.txt: launcher 0,53 1200x28 items 1
check: layout2.txt: launcher 0,53 1200x0
check: launcher.txt: last Shell launched
check@windows: launcher.txt: Shell|cmd.exe|/c exit
check@unix: launcher.txt: Shell|/bin/sh|-c exit
